      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Be very cautious with those foods when taking an MAOI, as they can cause dangerous interactions. Aged cheeses like cheddar and cured meats such as salami contain tyramine, which can lead to a hypertensive crisis. Soy sauce also contains compounds that can affect how your medication works. Please ask your doctor or pharmacist for a specific list of foods to avoid while on MAOIs.",
